WEBVTT

00:05:57.520 --> 00:06:01.690
these are a group of ideas
known in the industry as web3.

00:06:03.359 --> 00:06:07.988
And each and every one is built
on a foundation called the blockchain.

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:12.785
The important thing to understand
about blockchains

00:06:12.785 --> 00:06:15.579
is that they remove the need
for an intermediary.

00:06:16.747 --> 00:06:18.082
What do I mean by that?

00:06:18.124 --> 00:06:20.876
Well, each and every one of you,
I am sure, at some point,

00:06:20.918 --> 00:06:22.461
has put money in a bank account.

00:06:23.254 --> 00:06:24.797
And when you did that,

00:06:24.839 --> 00:06:27.091
you were actually trusting
an intermediary --

00:06:27.133 --> 00:06:28.342
in this case, a bank --

00:06:28.342 --> 00:06:30.719
to take care of that money on your behalf.